                            <h5 class="fw-bold">Articleship</h5>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
                                Mandatory 2.5 years of practical training under an Experienced Chartered Accountant.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

