                    <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-danger fs-6 me-3 px-3 py-2">2</span>
                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-0">CA Foundation (4 Months Preparation)</h4>
                </div>

                <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                    The entry-level exam covering Accounting, Business Laws, Quantitative Aptitude, and Business Economics. As per the updated ICAI syllabus, exams are now held three times a year—in January, May, and September. A well-prepared student clears Foundation in the first or second attempt.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
