                </div>

                <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                    Six subjects across two groups, as per the updated ICAI syllabus. Students begin their 2.5-year Articleship (practical training) after clearing at least one group of CA Intermediate. The Intermediate exam can be attempted group-by-group or both groups together, and is now held three times a year.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
