                </div>

                <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                    Mandatory practical training under an Experienced Chartered Accountant, updated to 2.5 years as per the new ICAI syllabus. During Articleship, students gain real-world exposure to auditing, taxation, and financial advisory work. CA Final preparation typically happens simultaneously during the later part of Articleship.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5 -->
