                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-0">CA Final (12–18 Months Preparation)</h4>
                </div>

                <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                    The most advanced level, covering six highly specialised subjects as per the updated ICAI syllabus. Candidates appear for CA Final in the last six months of Articleship or after completing it. Unlike Foundation and Intermediate, CA Final continues to be held twice a year—in May and November. Clearing CA Final earns you the prestigious ICAI membership.
